  "notes": "Labels from the diagram callouts; tiny silkscreen on the rendered PCB not transcribed. BUTTON (GPIO7) and NeoPixel (NEOPIXEL GPIO21, NEOPIXEL_POWER GPIO20) skipped. USB-A host port shown with a function table only (USB_HOST_DATA_PLUS GPIO16, USB_HOST_DATA_MINUS GPIO17, USB_HOST_5V_POWER GPIO18); skipped as a USB connector. STEMMA QT order follows the drawn connector wires left to right (GND, 3.3V, SDA, SCL). The STEMMA callout prints SCL with GPIO2 and SDA with GPIO3, the reverse of the right-header SCL (GPIO3) / SDA (GPIO2); copied as printed."
